        "en": "<p>Logic:</p><p>Output = (Number × 3) + 51</p><ul><li>39 × 3 + 51 = 168</li><li>48 × 3 + 51 = 195</li><li>71 × 3 + 51 = 264</li></ul>",
        "hi": "<p>तर्क:</p><p>आउटपुट = (संख्या × 3) + 51</p><p>39 × 3 + 51 = 168</p><p>48 × 3 + 51 = 195</p><p>71 × 3 + 51 = 264</p>"
